<title>USA: Tuesday Morning Q1 profit $0.09.</title>
<headline>Tuesday Morning Q1 profit $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net (profit)    $0.09	 (loss)   $0.09</p>
<p> Net (profit)    744	   (loss)   676</p>
<p> Revs		n/a			n/a</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   8,389		    7,851</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said it was profitable during its first quarter for the first time since it went public in 1986.</p>
<p>The company said gross margins improved because of wharehouse efficiences, and because it has become more proficient at advertising and marketing.</p>
<p>The company said it expects these factors to benefit its operating results for the rest of the year.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Tuesday Morning Corp.</p>
